    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you survive the night?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a relentless cycle of fear, you must survive against a deadly enemy using only your wits, tools, and a phone. Each night brings new challenges, requiring you to manage resources, monitor security cameras, complete objectives, and earn money through side jobs to upgrade your defenses. As the nights progress, the danger increases\u2014adapt, strategize, and endure, or fall victim to the terror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Night:</strong> Outsmart and evade the lurking danger before it gets to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phone-Based Mechanics:</strong> Use your phone to access security cameras, call for help, and activate defensive tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jobs &amp; Economy:</strong> Earn money by taking on side jobs, then use your earnings to buy vital upgrades and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty:</strong> Each night becomes more challenging, pushing your survival instincts to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Difficulty Mode:</strong> Adjust various settings to create your own terrifying experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere:</strong> Experience intense fear with dynamic lighting, eerie sound design, and unexpected scares.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to last until morning?<br><br><strong>Early access benefits:</strong><br><br>We will update the game every month, on launch you will have access to survival mode, here is what else you will have in the future\u00a0<br>-2 new job options<br>-7 new equipment<br>-4 new upgrade books with 5 volumes with each<br>-more mechanics for the player and the intruder (enemy)\u00a0<br>-overtime mode<br><br>The early access will NOT update the story mode throughout time, the complete story mode comes when the game is completely finish (for episode 1 at least)</p>",
